# =============================================================================
# .dockerignore — Ares/Furlong staging container (STAGING-DEPLOY P0.3)
# Vol III (Technical Infrastructure) / Vol IV (Operational Runbooks)
#
# This file is LOAD-BEARING for secret safety, not cosmetic. Two reasons:
#
#   1. Next.js output tracing (`output: "standalone"`) copies any root `.env*`
#      into `.next/standalone/.env` during `next build`. If a real `.env`
#      entered the build context and the build ran, the Neon DATABASE_URL
#      (host + password) would be BAKED INTO THE IMAGE. Excluding `.env*` here
#      guarantees the in-container build cannot trace a secret in.
#   2. We exclude the host's pre-built `.next` so the image is always built
#      fresh inside the container from clean source — never shipping a stale or
#      secret-contaminated local artifact.
#
# The runtime image gets ALL config from the environment at run time (Secret
# Manager -> process env). No secret ever lives in the image. (P0.3: "no
# secrets baked in"; verify:repo-secrets clean.)
# =============================================================================

# --- Secrets: NEVER enter the build context ---------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
Recovery Key.pdf
*recovery[ _-]key*
Credit_Summary_*.pdf
*_Caitlin_Hudson.pdf
*_Stuart_Fraass.pdf
*_Frances_Fraass.pdf
*_ssn*
*social_security*
*passport*
*drivers_license*
*tax_return*
*bank_statement*

# --- Build artifacts: rebuilt fresh inside the image ------------------------
.next
node_modules
out
dist

# --- Version control / tooling ----------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
*.md
!AGENTS.md

# --- Local / editor / OS noise ----------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode
.idea
.claude

# --- Test / coverage / logs -------------------------------------------------
coverage
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.eslintcache

# --- Infra (not needed in the app image) ------------------------------------
infra
artifacts
data
review-exports
journey-photos
work
scratch
tmp
